  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Winter Relief Campaign for families in Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Donate warmth - together we can ensure that 277 internally displaced Afghan families get through the cold season this winter!  Every year, Afghan winters result in deaths from frost and starvation. In the ongoing humanitarian catastrophe, the population is particularly vulnerable this year - and the first snow is falling already. If we take action now, we can provide a refugee camp in the north of the country with essential food and resources. Will you join us?</narrative>
  </description>
